WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:11.862
Here come the blobs.

2
00:00:11.863 --> 00:00:14.919
What do they see?

3
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.893
They see the beach.

4
00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:25.783
The blobs go to the beach.

5
00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:35.901
They run to the sand.

6
00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:55.001
They run to the water.

7
00:00:55.002 --> 00:01:05.944
They run to the chairs.

8
00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:21.575
They run to the shells.

9
00:01:21.576 --> 00:01:37.550
They run to the gulls.

10
00:01:37.551 --> 00:01:54.908
They run to the cotton candy.

11
00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:57.609
Blobs, watch out!

12
00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:14.953
Here come the gulls!

13
00:02:14.954 --> 00:02:17.398
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:17.399 --> 00:02:22.923
Good-bye!

